# The operator runbook was renamed CLAUDE-internal.md -> CLAUDE.local.md, which
# *.local.* already covers. This entry stays as a safety net: it costs one line,
# and dropping it would un-ignore the old filename in any clone or backup that
# still carries it — an INTERNAL file, one `git add` away from a public remote.
CLAUDE-internal.md

